# MaCSad administrative header

The header identifies the local control plane without owning application state.

## Component AdminHeader:
    View:
        css ".topbar { min-height: 74px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; padding: 16px clamp(20px,4vw,56px); color: #f8f6ef; background: #102c3b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14); } .brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; } .brand-mark { width: 38px; height: 38px; display: grid; place-items: center; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.32); border-radius: 12px; color: #102c3b; background: #d8ff72; font: 800 14px/1 ui-monospace, monospace; box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(216,255,114,.16); } .brand-copy strong { display: block; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: .02em; } .brand-copy span { display: block; margin-top: 2px; color: #b8cad1; font-size: 12px; } .top-status { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; color: #c9d7dc; font-size: 12px; } .pulse { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 999px; background: #d8ff72; box-shadow: 0 0 0 5px rgba(216,255,114,.12); } @media (max-width: 820px) { .top-status { display: none; } }"
        header [class="topbar"]:
            div [class="brand"]:
                div [class="brand-mark"]: "M∴"
                div [class="brand-copy"]:
                    strong: "MaCSad"
                    span: "Math + computer science auto-discovery"
            div [class="top-status"]:
                span [class="pulse"]: ""
                span: "Firebat One · local control plane"
